Additional TLS hardening on top of secure-by-default.patch.
- mask credentials in mirror URLs in the TLS error message (including an empty user name)
- verify certificates in the MetaCPAN and MetaDB index clients
- LWP backend: always verify the hostname when verify_SSL is set, and do not use LWP for HTTPS (including redirects) without ssl_opts (LWP < 6.00)
- LWP and Curl backends: reject redirects from HTTPS to plain HTTP when verify_SSL is set

